pushing [[Lok Lambert]] away with Touchram\nS2E51 Guggenheim Touchram.png|[[Guggenheim]] using Touchram\nS2E38 Dante Touchram Rippleburst.png|[[Dante Vale]] countering [[Rippleburst]] with Touchram\n</gallery>","text":"Image caption: Wilder pushing Lok Lambert away with Touchram\n\nImage caption: Guggenheim using Touchram\n\nImage caption: Dante Vale countering Rippleburst with Touchram"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT = Stormram\n|FR  = Toucher-bélier\n|POR = Repulsor, Raio-repulsor, Raio-pulsor}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Green-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Yellow-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","text":"Dutch: Stormram\nFrench: Toucher-bélier\nPortuguese: Repulsor, Raio-repulsor, Raio-pulsor"}],"full_text":"Touchram is a basic Seeker power that produces a crackling green energy that can be directed at a target. The concussive force can be used to repulse the target to create more distance.\n\nHistory\n\nDante Vale and Zhalia Moon used it once at the same time to cause a massive Touchram wave. [The Golden Asp]\n\nWhile battling against the Blood Spiral, Dante Vale used Touchram on his fists to attack a Silent Soldier similar to using the spell Dragonfist. [An Ally from the Organization]\n\nDante Vale used Touchram against Suits while riding his bike. [The Power of Umbra]\n\nOne version of this spell used by Lok Lambert instead has a blue aura. [LGS-056]\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: Wilder pushing Lok Lambert away with Touchram\n\nImage caption: Guggenheim using Touchram\n\nImage caption: Dante Vale countering Rippleburst with Touchram\n\nInternational Names\n\nDutch: Stormram\nFrench: Toucher-bélier\nPortuguese: Repulsor, Raio-repulsor, Raio-pulsor","raw_wikitext":"{{Stub|History details}}\n{{infobox spell\n| image = S1E18 Touchram.jpg\n| aura  = Yellow <br> Green <br> Blue (TCG)\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Huntik Foundation]] members <br> [[The Organization|Organization]] members\n| first = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n}}\n'''Touchram''' is a basic [[Seeker]] power that produces a crackling green energy that can be directed at a target. The concussive force can be used to repulse the target to create more distance.\n\n== History ==\n[[Dante Vale]] and [[Zhalia Moon]] used it once at the same time to cause a massive Touchram wave. {{source|The Golden Asp}}\n\nWhile battling against the [[Blood Spiral]], Dante Vale used Touchram on his fists to attack a [[Silent Soldier]] similar to using the spell [[Dragonfist]]. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}\n\n[[Dante Vale]] used Touchram against [[Suits]] while riding his [[Dante Vale's motorbike|bike]]. {{source|The Power of Umbra}}\n\nOne version of this spell used by [[Lok Lambert]] instead has a blue aura. {{source|LGS-056}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n==Gallery==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS2E30 Lok Wilder Touchram.jpg|[[Wilder]] pushing [[Lok Lambert]] away with Touchram\nS2E51 Guggenheim Touchram.png|[[Guggenheim]] using Touchram\nS2E38 Dante Touchram Rippleburst.png|[[Dante Vale]] countering [[Rippleburst]] with Touchram\n</gallery>\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT = Stormram\n|FR  = Toucher-bélier\n|POR = Repulsor, Raio-repulsor, Raio-pulsor}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Green-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Yellow-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","categories":["Article stubs","Blue-aura spells","Green-aura spells","Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Offensive spells","Organization magic","Yellow-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:1987","status":"resolved","target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik Foundation","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1987"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2257","status":"resolved","target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1997","status":"resolved","target_title":"Seeker","label":"Seeker","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Seeker","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1997"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2000","status":"resolved","target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3288","status":"resolved","target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4383","status":"resolved","target_title":"Silent Soldier","label":"Silent Soldier","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Silent_Soldier","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4383"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2016","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dragonfist","label":"Dragonfist","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dragonfist","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2016"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050